{
 "source": "tts:kokoro:af_heart",
 "precision": "tts",
 "offset": 0,
 "duration": 77.627,
 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Every answer the twin gives has a price, and you can watch it.",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 3.194
  },
  {
   "text": "In the room, a neon sign shows what each call cost, to the millionth of a dollar.",
   "start": 3.444,
   "end": 8.086
  },
  {
   "text": "It reads the gateway's own reply, not a dashboard.",
   "start": 8.336,
   "end": 11.157
  },
  {
   "text": "Every model call goes through the gateway, and every call carries four things: the provider, the model, the tokens, and the cost.",
   "start": 11.407,
   "end": 18.876
  },
  {
   "text": "Local answers cost nothing.",
   "start": 19.126,
   "end": 20.748
  },
  {
   "text": "The paid fallback is Claude Haiku: ten cents per million tokens in, fifty cents out.",
   "start": 20.997,
   "end": 26.152
  },
  {
   "text": "Why Haiku?",
   "start": 26.402,
   "end": 27.198
  },
  {
   "text": "In Hareet's words: \"we chose haiku since our context base is small and manually evaluated haiku and sonnet.\"",
   "start": 27.448,
   "end": 34.072
  },
  {
   "text": "Money is counted in whole micro-dollars, never a float, in the gateway's own database.",
   "start": 34.322,
   "end": 39.653
  },
  {
   "text": "Every call is also traced in Langfuse, which runs inside the stack.",
   "start": 39.903,
   "end": 43.941
  },
  {
   "text": "And it's locked down: no route out, sign-up switched off, its own telemetry off, and no prompts or answers kept, unless sampling is switched on in development.",
   "start": 44.191,
   "end": 53.691
  },
  {
   "text": "Grafana puts spend beside latency and errors: today, this month, and the fallback's own budget.",
   "start": 53.941,
   "end": 59.608
  },
  {
   "text": "Why measure all of it?",
   "start": 59.858,
   "end": 60.982
  },
  {
   "text": "Because the meter is the control.",
   "start": 61.232,
   "end": 62.992
  },
  {
   "text": "Cloud billing alerts lag by hours;",
   "start": 63.242,
   "end": 65.276
  },
  {
   "text": "this one decides in real time.",
   "start": 65.526,
   "end": 67.245
  },
  {
   "text": "A full evaluation run, a hundred and eighty-six cases on Haiku, cost about twenty-one cents.",
   "start": 67.495,
   "end": 73.334
  },
  {
   "text": "A real-time cost meter.",
   "start": 73.584,
   "end": 75.034
  },
  {
   "text": "Built in the open, at hareet dot A I.",
   "start": 75.284,
   "end": 77.626
  }
 ],
